# Speaker Headshots

Speaker headshot images are now stored in Azure Blob Storage.
Container: speakerheadshots
Storage Account: azcorestorage2026

URL pattern: https://azcorestorage2026.blob.core.windows.net/speakerheadshots/{filename}

Naming convention: {speakerId}.jpg (or .png, .webp)
Example: rick-claus-a1b2.jpg
